mapping_examples:
Function call mapping example: internal tool invocation -> OA function_call chunk:
1) Model signals function_call(name="get_sales", args={}) -> shim emits OA 'function_call' envelope with name and arguments stringified
2) Tool result returned to runtime -> shim wraps as assistant message with role="assistant", content=null, function_call={name:"get_sales", arguments:"{"total": 12345}"}
